window.products.push({"id":550004,"name":"Nuwave Bravo XL Air Fryer Toaster Smart Oven, 12-in-1 Countertop Grill/Griddle Combo, 30-Qt XL Capacity, 50F-500F adjustable in precise 5F increments.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":152.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817R+zAFZFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MAKE ADJUSTMENTS ON-THE-FLY – Want hotter temperature or need to cook it longer? Simply adjust on-the-fly any time. Fine-tune time and temperature any time in the cooking process. Bravo’s intuitive digital controls are easy to operate. INTUITIVE DIGITAL CONTROLS - Set cook temperatures from 50°F to 500°F adjustable in precise 5°F increments. Unlike the primitive methods that regulate temperature by turning the heater on and off, our heater never turns off while cooking. LINEAR THERMAL (LINEAR T) TECHNOLOGY – Linear T executes the set temp accurately throughout the cooking process by continuously monitoring temp fluctuations & making constant adjustments every second to maintain the set temp to ensure perfect results. DUAL HEAT ZONES - Customize the top, bottom heaters and convection fan independently for true surround cooking. To bake a perfect pizza, set bottom heaters at full power & top heaters at 30% for crispy crunch crust and perfectly melted cheesy toppings. INTEGRATED SMART DIGITAL THERMOMETER – Once the desired doneness temperature is set, Bravo constantly monitors the internal temperature of your food and automatically ends the cooking process when the desired internal temperature is reached. CARRYOVER COOKING - Bravo also features carryover cooking mode. It compensates for the carryover cooking that will inevitably occur after cooking. When engaged, this feature ensures that the meat or fish is not overcooked while resting. MULTI-LAYER COOKING - With 4 rack positions and multi-purpose racks, multi-layer cooking is more convenient than ever before. Bravo’s heavy-duty racks can withstand loads over 30 pounds. Cooking delicious meals for the entire family is now easy. 112 PRESETS- Bravo is programmed with 12 preset cooking functions for air frying, grilling, baking, broiling, roasting, dehydrating, reheating, defrosting, toasting & more. It also has additional 100 pre-programmed recipe presets. GRILL INDOORS - The super non-stick grill/griddle plate is thick - ideal for absorbing & retaining heat for excellent grill marks & overall searing. Set the auto preheat. Insert the thermostat; set the desired doneness temp; let Bravo do the rest. WHAT’S INCLUDED – Bravo XL Air Fryer Toaster Smart Oven comes with 1 non-stick reversible grill/griddle, 1 grill/griddle rack, 1 heavy-duty wire cooking rack, 1 crumb tray, 1 smart digital thermostat, 1 owner’s manual, 1 quick start guide, and 1 recipe book.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817R+zAFZFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nuwave","source_asin":"B091RM7GCK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-550004","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091RM7GCK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091RM7GCK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
