window.products.push({"id":550058,"name":"TRIGPACK Insulated Lunch Bag for Men & Women - Tactical Lunchbox for Adults - Fits 2-3 Meal Containers or 12 Water Bottles - For Camping, Work, Picnic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81skOtygG-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Isn’t it a bother to have multiple bags when you’re going for a hike or picnic? Carrying a lot of stuff when you’re going on a picnic or hiking trip can cause you problems. However, if you leave a bag or two behind, you may lack essential tools or food that might end up causing you to abandon your trip. When you end up taking everything with you, you might get flustered. You may even have to stop and open all your bags just to find the one tool you need. Good thing we’ve got a versatile bag that’s perfect for your next camping escapade. The TRIGPACK Insulated Lunch Bag has all the storage space you need for food, water bottles, and tools when you’re outdoors. The interior is made of 8mm thick PE foam to keep food warm or drinks cold for up to 24 hours. It also features 4-layer construction with polyester, PE foam, non-woven fabric, and PEVA sealed lining. It’s built to withstand odors or stains no matter what you store in the bag. The lunch bag comes in four stylish colors. Tactical gear enthusiasts will love the coyote, black camo, and desert camo designs, while obsidian black is great for just about everyone. Plus, strategically placed pockets, hook and loop strips, and mole webbing can be used to store tools and gadgets like multi-tool pocket knives, bottle openers, and lighters. A 56-inch adjustable padded sling makes carrying the bag comfortable even when it’s full. If you prefer to carry it by hand, its reinforced handle is durable enough to without support from the sling. More reasons to choose this lunch bag: - Excellent for camping, fishing, mountain climbing, or hunting trips - A good everyday lunch bag for work - Easy to clean and maintain - Spill-proof and leak-proof interior Better be prepared and have all you need when you’re outdoors. Add the TRIGPACK Insulated Lunch Bag to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81skOtygG-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09GF9VHWM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-550058","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GF9VHWM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GF9VHWM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
