window.products.push({"id":550241,"name":"Marchpower Cooling Pillow Cases for Hot Sleepers Queen Size, Japanese Arc-Chill Cooling Pillowcase Double Design 2 Pack, Zipperd Breathable Skin-Frien","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814xxEY+04L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Latest Arc-Chill Cooling Fiber Tech】Marchpower summer cooling pillow cases made of latest Japanese Arc-Chill cooling fiber technology, which add jade factor into the fiber, to give you cool-to-touch feeling. The cooling material will naturally wick humidity away from your skin, accelerate moisture evaporation and reduce skin temperature by 35 to 41°F, help you get a moisture-free and sound sleep for hot summer night. An ideal choice for hot sleepers to combat night sweats and insomnia. 【Professional Cooling Healthy Pillowcase】Marchpower Cooling Pillowcase for summer with OEKO-TEX Standard-100 certification, Our summer cool pillowcases ensures the cool effect and makes sure it's fade-resistant, wrinkle-resistant, and long-lasting. The intricate weaving makes Marchpower summer chill pillowcase soft to the touch and sustains the coziness. The smooth surface will reduce friction to your skin and hair, which is great for preventing wrinkles, dry skin, and frizzled hair. 【Distinctive Double-Side Design Pillow Cases】Not just for outstanding coolness, the summer cool pillow protector also made of premium long-staple cotton for another side. It's soft but strong, cool and airy, smooth and comfortable. The super comfortable and soft side is suitable for all season, you would have an unprecedented sound sleep with Marchpower double-sided cooling pillow cases, friendly to hot sleeper,hot flashes and night sweats. 【Exquisite Hidden Zipper Closure】The wide opening of Marchpower cooling pillow case is very convenient for putting in and pulling out pillow. The Arc-Chill cozy pillow cases would fit any standard or queen-size pillow. The hidden zipper and the exquisite stitches will hold your pillow perfectly without breaking its beauty or showing its seam. The luxury color will blend well with your other bedding and provides a classic look and an extra chill & comfortable feel. 【Perfect Bedding Choice for Hot Sleeper & Night Sweats】2 pack luxury cooling pillowcase with double design, suitable for all seasons use, must-have for hot summer. The cooling pillow cases is a good solution for sweaty and hot sleepers. The classic color blends well with bedroom decor. Machine washable (better with a wash bag), just dry in the shade, easy to care. The cooling summer pillow case is a unique gift for your beloved one.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814xxEY+04L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marchpower","source_asin":"B08B7V1RDV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-550241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B7V1RDV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B7V1RDV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
