window.products.push({"id":550257,"name":"Festive, Large Red Plaid Sweater Knit Christmas Stocking 1pc. Rustic, Buffalo Check Xmas Gift Holder Has Faux Fur Cuff and Reindeer. Holiday Sock Grea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.18,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812WvN0ZlLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make the holidays cozier this winter with our elegant, fully-lined stockings, large enough for all your favorite goodies. Adults love the sophisticated, nostalgic design, while kids and babies like the fun and fuzzy feel. Don't forget one for your fur baby; these can hold a giant dog bone! The strong, quality material ensures that your family will be able to enjoy these essential keepsakes for years. Fill with cookies and wine to make a unique host gift for parties Stuff a stocking with a bottle of champagne, treats and a greeting card to make a cute and festive host gift at a holiday party this winter season. By using these stockings instead of traditional wrapping paper or bags, you create an adorable present AND are being more eco-friendly! The perfect decoration for any office or retail establishment These ornamental stockings are a top choice for any commercial store, restaurant, bar, business, school classroom, shopping mall, or company office. They add a bright cheer that helps us celebrate throughout the joyous winter season! DIY holiday crafts just got better! Buy these socks in bulk to create a pretty door wreath, themed stocking garland or stuff them and sew shut to make funky throw pillows. Customize them by attaching buttons, ribbon, applique and pockets to make a more personalized decoration. The creative ideas are endless! What’s in the box? You'll receive 1 (one) fully-lined red buffalo check print stocking with a prancing reindeer silhouette in white, a fluffy gray faux fur cuff and a sturdy loop for hanging. The stocking measures 10 inches wide by 20 inches tall. Lifetime 100% money-back satisfaction guarantee! If you aren’t completely satisfied with your order, simply email us, and we will respond within 24 hours to make it right even on the weekends. We absolutely guarantee your satisfaction or your money back!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812WvN0ZlLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eucatus","source_asin":"B08KYFNZ14","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-550257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KYFNZ14","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KYFNZ14","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
