window.products.push({"id":550259,"name":"MIULEE Blackout Valance Rod Pocket Thermal Insulated Window Treatment Tiers Solid Short Curtain for Small Window Bedroom 52 x 18 Inches 1 Panel Beige","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ER6z55PrS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WELL MADE- Each package contains ONLY 1 piece of MIULEE blackout valance. Each blackout valance measures 52 inches long and 18 inches wide with a rod pocket which would fit most standard curtain rods. UPMARKET FABRIC- Woven from high quality polyester, innovative triple-layer textile technology makes the fabric soft and sturdy. Comfortable to touch without loose thread. LIGHT BLOCKING- It’s a wise choice to use MIULEE blackout valance to cover the upper portion of the windows for blocking unnecessary light. The moment it darkens your room, it also gives an elegant atmosphere to your room. MIX AND MATCH- Our blackout valance can not only hang separately, but also match well with other curtains. Different combinations can bring different experiences to your living room, bedroom, kitchen or any other small windows. WARM TIPS- Due to different screen display, the color of actual item may vary slightly from images. MIULEE TOUCH YOUR LIFE.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ER6z55PrS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIULEE","source_asin":"B0B9F9L2JK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-550259","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9F9L2JK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9F9L2JK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":550260,"name":"Tabletop Fountain Indoor Fountain Waterfall Over Cascading Rocks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91C8sK65CzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is an exquisite tabletop water fountain. The pictures do not do justice. The actual fountain is far more beautiful than pictures.In this table top fountain water cascades into multiple directions from the first rocky slope. From the forward fall, the water falls onto another rock formation and then again onto another and before finally falling into nature reservoir. From the side fall, the water cascades twice again before falling into nature resorvoir. Notice the details of the rock formation and tree trunk. The moss on the rocks add a splendid touch. You can also see some green bushes around.The fountain also includes 4 color changing LED lights that help to illuminate the fountain and makes the water glimmer and elegantly reflect off of surrounding surfaces.The calming sound of naturally flowing water provides the perfect backdrop for sleep, relaxation and concentration.WARRANTY:Please contact us via Amazon for warranty / replacement parts or support.*The fountain has 6 months warranty for any water leaks.*The water pump with LED has 3 months warranty.*The fountain is made of poly-resin material and comes fully assembled. All our products are shipped directly by Amazon from Amazon warehouses and also available under Amazon Prime. So enjoy worry free shopping.QUICK TIPS:Tip #1: Read the instruction manual for operation and troubleshooting.Tip #2: Make sure the fountain pump is properly immersed in water. See the instruction manual.Tip #3: All pumps are tested for quality assurance. If you hear pump noise then it is because the pump is not properly immersed in water (try putting in more water, refer to instructional manual) or not properly placed / laying flat inside the fountain (try place adjusting the pump slowly in the fountain until pump noise goes away completely).Tip #5: Note that water pumps do not come with on/off switch.Tip #6: Relax, enjoy and melt away the stress!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91C8sK65CzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ImagiWonder","source_asin":"B01MF69NUW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-550260","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MF69NUW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MF69NUW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
