window.products.push({"id":550643,"name":"COSTWAY Ice Cream Maker, 1.1-Quart Automatic Electronic Gelato Maker with 3 Operation Modes, Built-In Compressor, Portable Homemade Dessert Maker with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cdTuty4uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍨【3 In 1 Ice Cream Maker】There are 3 operation modes to satisfy your needs of making different types of desserts. You can adjust the control knob for mixing only, cooling only and ice cream mode (maximum 40 minutes) as needed. The easy-to-use control panel facilitates homemade dessert making. 🍨【Keep Cool Function】To maintain fresh taste and texture of ice cream, the machine will automatically start every 10 minutes and cool for 10 minutes if the ice cream is not eaten or stored in time (cooling time: 1 hour). When it is finished, the machine will shut off automatically after 10 short beeps. 🍨【Compressor & Motor Self-Protection】3-min waiting time protects the compressor when switching the operation modes. And you can also unplug the power to restart the machine without waiting. Besides, the motor protection device will shut off automatically ensuring the lasting usage of the motor. 🍨【DIY Ice Cream】This countertop ice cream maker allows you to make various delicious homemade desserts in minutes. You can create your own unique taste by controlling the intake of ingredients. Add all materials in the frozen bowl and choose one operation mode, waiting to enjoy. 🍨【Easy To Clean】Since smooth ABS surface, the daily maintenance is easy to finish with a wet towel. In addition, all non-electric parts are detachable for safe cleaning under water, such as transparent lid, mixing paddles and 1.1 quart freezer bowl. And these parts are easy to assemble for reuse.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cdTuty4uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSTWAY","source_asin":"B08W9JPSXT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-550643","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W9JPSXT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W9JPSXT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
