window.products.push({"id":550669,"name":"GOLD TEXTILES 100% Cotton Washcloth - 12 Pack | 13x13 inches | Grey - Ultra Soft, Highly Absorbent, Long Lasting and Quick Drying - Hotel & Spa Collec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81t5xJkzO8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Imported - 100% Ringspun Cotton Premium Washcloth 13x13 Inches Soft & Absorbent - All edges are reinforced to minimize the possibility of being unraveled. Our towel sets are made of 100% Ring-spun cotton which allows them to be super soft, fluffy and plusher towel sets. These towels are lightweight for quick drying yet gives a very soft hand feel and good absorbency. The finest genuine cotton remains fresh and soft after multiple washes of these cleaning towels Long Lasting Quality - Each washcloth is measuring by 13 x 13 inch, their reusability you’ll never run out for thousands of uses to come. Gold Textiles Wash Cloths have strong professionally hemmed edges are carefully crafted to enhance the towels quality and durability, These are washcloths best better than for paper towels. It is also perfect for a baby bath Ideal Gift Choice - These cotton face washcloths feel super soft against your skin. Plus, they add a clean and modern look to your house. Perfect for holidays, housewarming gifts, wedding gifts, Mother’s Day gifts, engagement gifts, bridal showers, birthdays, Christmas, and homecoming. They can be used at every Spa, Pool, Resort,Home bath or Hotels Care Instructions - Machine washable and lasting- long.These bulk washcloths towels are specially processed to make the dryer take less time, thus saving time and energy costs. tumble try on low heat or hang to air dry","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81t5xJkzO8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOLD TEXTILES","source_asin":"B0BXKX87QT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-550669","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXKX87QT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXKX87QT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":550670,"name":"Kate and Laurel Sylvie Safari Animal Framed Canvas Art Set by Amy Peterson 6 Piece Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Bkm4QwVeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The sweetness of these safari animals is perfectly captured in this adorable art print set by Amy Peterson. They'd look great together on a wall or hung separately throughout your house. Printed and framed in the USA in Waunakee, Wisconsin, this framed floating canvas art set will be a pleasure to look at every day in your living room, bedroom, nursery, or any room in the home. Printed on gallery wrapped canvas and framed with a gray-washed finish lightweight polystyrene frame, this colorful wall art each has two hangers already attached to the natural wood colored MDF back for easy wall display. The outer dimensions of each framed canvas print are 13 inches tall by 13 inches wide by 1.6 inches deep. Artist Biography: Amy Peterson is a graphic designer and artist who lives and works in Northern California. She started her artistic career at an early age and later perfected her craft as a artist while working as production designer in many of San Francisco's technical creative agencies. Art has always been Amy's first love and she is in her highest \"happy place\" when she is busy creating colorful and uplifting art. Good coffee and music are essential in Amy's creative world and she is passionate about creating work that brings about feelings of joy and good vibes!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Bkm4QwVeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kate and Laurel","source_asin":"B07KB4SM7N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-550670","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KB4SM7N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KB4SM7N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
