window.products.push({"id":550688,"name":"Hamilton Hills 22x30 inch Gold Brushed Metal Framed Vanity Mirrors for Wall | Rectangular Square Corner Glass Panel Wall Mirror | Deep Set Design Bath","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":164.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xlvsV-qwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SIMPLE CLASS: Our contemporary wall mirror is the perfect solution for a clean expensive looking gold vanity mirror or bathroom mirror. A brushed metal finish has 1 1/4\" depth and a tiny 1/16\" front reveal edge. The mirrored plate glass is front set giving the mirror a substantial look and high end finish. Overall rectangular dimensions of 22\" x 30\" this modern rectangle mirror goes with many different decor options. SAFE AND EASY TO INSTALL: Our glass is safely custom mounted and protected by the surrounding frame construction. The gold mirror is recessed into the deep frame and floated from the frame edges. The bathroom vanity mirror comes with reinforced D-ring hanging clips as well as the wall hardware and screws to easily hang the mirror on walls in a bathroom, entry way or over a table. The vanity mirror hangs both horizontally or vertically (landscape or portrait). 3 GENERATIONS OF EXCELLENCE: Our family has been manufacturing and producing mirrors for over 3 generations. We stand by the quality of our product and your experience. A family owned business with simple principles. Affordable quality from an American company. EXCEPTIONAL QUALITY: We use premium materials not found in other lesser quality imitation mirrors you will see. Our mirrors are made to strict trade-secret standards and pass a rigorous 8 point inspection. Every mirror comes with our certification of authenticity. There is a reason others copy Hamilton Hills. We set the standards and others try and emulate. Elegant and stylish, this contemporary brushed metal wall mirror is the perfect addition to your home. It features a beautiful squared mirror surrounded by a frame with a brushed metal finish. This bathroom wall decor piece has a deep tone that will look great in any setting. With its simple, yet elegant design this Squared wall mirror can be used in bedrooms, bathrooms, or even hallways.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xlvsV-qwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hamilton Hills","source_asin":"B081S5TM9Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-550688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081S5TM9Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081S5TM9Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":550689,"name":"TMACTIME Fly Fans for Tables Effective Fly Repellent Fan Keeps Flies Away with Soft Blades USB or Batteries Powered Portable Fly Fan for Picnic BBQ Pa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kV0opqbWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Physical and Portable】TMACTIME fly fans for tables use a physical method to repel flies. Therefore, there will be no side effects and no impact on the body. All you need to do is turn on the switch and you can enjoy your meal without any interruption. Moreover, the fly fan is lightweight and can be folded. After folding its body is shortened by half, which means you can take it out effortlessly and create a fly-free environment. 【About Power Supply】The fly repellent fan has two power supply ways. You can choose to use 2AA batteries (not included) or TYPE-C cable for power supply. Two power supply ways provide convenience for indoor and outdoor use. You can use TYPE-C cable indoors because there is a power supply indoors. And it is not suitable to use TYPE-C cable outdoors without power supply, so battery power supply way is the best choice for outdoors. 【Reflective Fan Blades】There are some reflective patterns on the fan blades, which can create a confusing environment for flies by reflecting lights when rotating at 360°. This reflective patterns are designed for flies, which don't like the reflecting lights and will stay away from the area covered by the lights. And it is worth noting that in order to ensure the normal operation of the fly fans for tables, the fan blades cannot be removed after they are installed. 【Soft-stop Technology and Soundless】Considering the issue of safety and protection, the fly fans are equipped with soft-stop technology. When the fly repellent fan is turning, if an object touches the fan blades, it will stop spinning immediately. And after the object is removed, it turns again. Furthermore, the fan blades are soft. So it won't hurt objects or even our hands. What's more, the blades rotate quietly and do not make any noise. So you can get a quiet and fly-free environment. 【Keep Your Food Clean】For flies, food is the most attractive, and they will swirl around it once they find it. And fly fans for tables are designed to repel flies. Just put one or several fly repellent fans around the food and the flies will not appear nearby. So TMACTIME fly fans for tables can be a great help in your life, whether you are in the kitchen and dining room, or out camping and picnicking, it can get you out of trouble from flies.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kV0opqbWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TMACTIME","source_asin":"B0C4DF6TMB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-550689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4DF6TMB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4DF6TMB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
