window.products.push({"id":550791,"name":"Continental 18BE, 18-Gallon Step-On Polypropylene Waste Receptacle, Rectangular, Beige (Case of 1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81U3klwqOcL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Continental Step-On waste receptacle is a rectangular, polypropylene trash can with a tight-fitting lid to control odors and keep pests out. Polypropylene has a higher melting point than polyethylene to provide greater fire resistance. The step pedal opens the lid, allowing for sanitary, hands-free use. The 23-gallon model has two caster wheels on the base for added mobility. The waste receptacle meets Factory Mutual (FM) 6921 for containers of combustible waste. The 18-gallon and 23-gallon models also have California State Fire Marshall (CSFM) approval for fire safety. Trash cans are used for the disposal and temporary storage of garbage. They are typically made of plastic or metal and sometimes have a top or lid to contain odors and waste. Certain garbage cans meet Occupational Safety and Health Administration (OSHA) requirements for the disposal of medical waste or National Sanitation Foundation/American National Standards Institute (NSF/ANSI) requirements for food handling and processing. Others include a lock to prevent unauthorized access, safeguard confidential materials, and comply with Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act (HIPAA) requirements. Waste bins can also be color-coded to facilitate the separation of recyclable waste, such as bottles, cans, paper, and general refuse. Ash/trash cans typically include an ash tray on top for cigarette disposal. Trash cans are used in virtually all commercial and industrial environments. Continental manufactures plastic and metal products such as restroom supplies, buckets, refuse containers, carts, and trigger sprayers for the janitorial and food service industries. The company is headquartered in Bridgeton, MO.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81U3klwqOcL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Continental","source_asin":"B005QS8KH6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-550791","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005QS8KH6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005QS8KH6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
