window.products.push({"id":550811,"name":"Bormioli Rocco Planeo Gran Rosso Large Red Wine Glasses (4-Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gE4VP5vKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This set comprises 4 large red wine glasses that have an elegant and refined laser-cut design, adding modern style to your drinkware collection. Their larger size is ideal for enjoying bold and full-bodied red wines given that the increased surface area of the mouth allows the intricate aromas and flavours of the wine to aerate, which in turn enhances the tasting experience. Not only does this set make the perfect gift for any wine-lover, but their stylish appearance and clever construction means they are of a high enough standard to be used in hospitality and catering. Crafted from premium quality toughened star glass, they are highly durable and can withstand repetitive dishwasher use. This is due to the fact that all stemware in the Planeo collection have undergone the XLT process, a treatment applied to the surface of the stems that ensures stemware resistance to the most frequent causes of breakage (washing, twisting etc.). Additionally, XLT protects the stem from abrasion and maintains its sturdiness over time - Laboratory tests confirm the constant level of protection even after repeated dishwasher cycles. Product dimensions: 55.5cl (18¾ oz) capacity, 216mm (8½\") height, 92mm (3⅝\") max diameter Ø.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gE4VP5vKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bormioli Rocco","source_asin":"B08C2SK1TL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-550811","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C2SK1TL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C2SK1TL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":550812,"name":"Hammock for Bearded Dragons, Orange Red Lavendar Batik Fabric with Suction Cup Hooks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91sT4Th-0iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These hammocks by Carolina Designer Dragons provide a comfortable, elevated vantage spot that bearded dragons are known to enjoy in their houses. These hammocks also feature the same “hand-sewn in the U.S.A.”, machine-washable benefits as the Chaise Lounges by Carolina Designer Dragons. The sewn-in internal batting gives a comfortable feel for your bearded dragon and won’t get lumpy after machine washing. Hammock size measures 16” x 16” x 22” and comes with three suction cup hooks; rated for 3 pounds. We are now including these suction cup hooks instead of the adhesive hooks because more people use glass style cages than the wood or melamine style cages. We do sell the adhesive hooks separately for use with the wood or melamine style cages. We tried other hammocks on the market that have suction cups grommeted to the hammock. What we found was that to clean the hammock, you had to pull the suction cups off the side of the cage. Over time, this decreased the effectiveness of the suction cups to the point that they didn’t work. Then, since they were physically attached to the hammock, the entire hammock went into the garbage. Some other hammocks on the market are made from a plastic mesh or seagrass, not something you want to just throw into the washing machine. So when they get soiled (poop), you end up having to scrub them clean by hand with a small brush; reserved just for this task. When positioning your hammock consider the height of your hammock in relation to your dragon. You want the front curved edge to be low enough for your dragon to climb into. This may include the use of a habitat accessory such as a Stacked Rock or a Natural Habitat Rock to climb onto first. Both of these habitat accessories are available separately from Carolina Custom Cages, a division of Carolina Designer Dragons, Inc.; a boutique breeder of bearded dragons, selections on our website.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91sT4Th-0iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Carolina Designer Dragons","source_asin":"B012BLM1UW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-550812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B012BLM1UW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B012BLM1UW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
