window.products.push({"id":550906,"name":"CAVLA Summer Window Clings 8 Sheets Fun in The Sun Summer Beach Pool Party Static Window Stickers Decals Decorations for Summer Hawaiian Tropical Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810Mli+cIZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These cute summer window clings will make your windows look creative in this coming summer. Hope you enjoy your time to decorate your windows with your friends and family. Specifications: - Material: Electrostatic membrane PVC - Quantity: 8 sheets summer beach window clings. - Size: Each sheets measures 11.8 inch x 7.9 inch - Easy to use for any smooth surface, stick it all by themselves, good stickiness for a long time. - Reusable and durable for next year use. - NO CLUE, NO TAPE, NO MESS. Clear and Vibrant Colors Clear and vibrant print colors on these summer elements like fun in the sun words, summer time words, sun, ice cream, swimming circle, juice, fruit, flip flops, flamingo, coconut tree, etc, will definitely add vibrant feelings to your house. Surprise your families or friends with this beautiful summer window decal from trendy window designs! Double Sides Prints These cute summer hawaii window decals, are double-side printed, so you can see the image from both sides of the window, look so adorable on the windows or glass door, your families or friends will be happy with the window clings and can't move eyes from them. Large Summer Window Clings Each sheets measures 11.8 inch X 7.9 inch, them can be clearly seen on the window no matter from inside or outside. How to use? 1. Make sure the surface is smooth and without any texture. Or the air will into the gap between the clings and surface then make the clings fall off. 2. Clean the surface to make sure there is no dust and grease on the surface. 3. Spray a little water on the surface. Water will make them stick better. 4. Put the clings on and remove the remaining water. Keep in mind these stickers are non-adhesive! These won't stick to most walls unless the finish is very glossy. Package Includes: 8 Sheets of Summer Fun In The Sun Window Clings","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810Mli+cIZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAVLA","source_asin":"B0928DVVZM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-550906","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0928DVVZM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0928DVVZM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
